      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Africa Palm Oil Initiative (APOI) national workshops and meetings
2. National Oil Palm Platform
 Oil Palm Platform meetings were convened by Solidaridad and discussions were mostly on the RSPO NI and initiation of issues that led to the decision to have a national oil palm value chain policy document
3. FAO RAI gender platform
4. Responsible Agriculture Investment platform on Land and inclusive business models We participated and contributed to the RAI platform on land and inclusive business where examples of inclusive business models were presented and discussed towards more inclusion of smallholder in agri-SME and agri-investments
5. VGGT National Technical Working Group. We participated in the technical working group to push the agenda for the passing of the land bill. The dialogues were organised through the existing platforms.</narrative>
